      "content": "{name} 선수와 숙소 앞 분식집에 갔다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You went to the snack bar outside the dorm with {name}.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9213593a-97af-54cc-92ce-0a53b585c7b1",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "여기 떡볶이 진짜 맛있어요.\n감독님이랑 밖에서 밥 먹는 거 처음이에요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The tteokbokki here is seriously good.\nThis is the first time I've eaten out with you, Coach.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "673a5537-6ad1-59d1-acad-42088d1db1bc",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 5,
